<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-bs-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for Paws & Home pet adoption shelter.">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Paws &amp; Home</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>

  <header class="site-header navbar navbar-expand-lg sticky-top">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/home" class="logo navbar-brand" aria-label="Paws and Home — Home">
        🐾 Paws <span>&amp;</span> Home
      </a>

      <button
        class="nav-toggle navbar-toggler"
        id="nav-toggle"
        type="button"
        data-bs-toggle="collapse"
        data-bs-target="#nav-menu"
        aria-label="Open navigation menu"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="nav-menu"
      >
        <span class="navbar-toggler-icon">
          <span class="hamburger-bar"></span>
          <span class="hamburger-bar"></span>
          <span class="hamburger-bar"></span>
        </span>
      </button>

      <nav class="main-nav collapse navbar-collapse" id="nav-menu" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="/home" class="nav-link">Home</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="/home#pets" class="nav-link">Adopt</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="/home#about" class="nav-link">About&nbsp;Us</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="/adopt" class="nav-link">Apply</a></li>
          <li class="nav-item"><a href="#" class="nav-link" id="logout-link">Log&nbsp;Out</a></li>
        </ul>
        <button
          class="theme-toggle ms-lg-3 mt-2 mt-lg-0"
          id="theme-toggle"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Toggle dark mode"
          title="Toggle dark mode"
        >🌙</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="legal-section py-5" aria-labelledby="legal-heading">
      <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px;">
        <h1 id="legal-heading" class="mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated text-muted mb-4">Last updated: March 31, 2026</p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          When you use our adoption application form, we collect the personal information
          you provide, including your full name, email address, phone number, and details
          about your living situation. We do not collect information automatically through
          cookies or tracking technologies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          We use the information you submit solely to process adoption applications and
          communicate with you about available pets. We will never sell, rent, or share
          your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">3. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          Your information is stored securely and access is limited to authorized shelter
          staff. We retain application data for up to 12 months after submission, after
          which it is permanently deleted.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">4. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your
          personal data at any time. To make a request, please contact us using the
          information on our <a href="/adopt">application page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted
          on this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4 mb-2">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out through
          our <a href="/adopt">contact form</a> or email us at
          <strong>privacy@pawsandhome.org</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer bg-dark text-light py-4 mt-auto">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <p class="mb-2">&copy; 2026 Paws &amp; Home. Made with ❤️ for animals everywhere.</p>
      <p class="mb-0">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-light" aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms" class="text-light">Terms of Service</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/auth.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
